<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83375" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίτῡρον</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ], τό</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>husks of corn, bran</i>, in sg., <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				8.4.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.85.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.481
			</span></i>: mostly in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
				21
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				355.87
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, etc.: used in magical ceremonies, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.259
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				2.33
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>bran-like eruption</i> on the skin, esp. the head, <i>scurf,
				dandruff</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>bran-like sediment in urine</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Nat.Hom.</u>
				14
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
